ological train-test split was used.\n","The first 80% of observations were used for training.\n","The latest 20% were used for future-period testing.\n","TimeSeriesSplit was used during hyperparameter tuning.\n","\n","DATA-LEAKAGE CONTROL\n","casual and registered were excluded because\n","casual + registered equals the target cnt.\n","\n","MOST IMPORTANT FEATURE\n","{most_important_feature}\n","\n","BUSINESS USE\n","The forecast can support bike allocation,\n","staff planning, shortage reduction,\n","maintenance scheduling and demand management.\n","\"\"\"\n","\n","print(project_summary)\n","\n","with open(\n","    os.path.join(\n","        REPORT_PATH,\n","        \"project_summary.txt\"\n","    ),\n","    \"w\",\n","    encoding=\"utf-8\"\n",") as file:\n","    file.write(project_summary)"],"metadata":{"colab":{"base_uri":"https://localhost:8080/"},"id":"Fbrqt5F2OAGr","executionInfo":{"status":"ok","timestamp":1791793570938,"user_tz":-330,"elapsed":28,"user":{"displayName":"Tanmay Pandey","userId":"08267603830918158100"}},"outputId":"efafdbb7-d9e9-438c-a321-e25036ce9e34"},"execution_count":58,"outputs":[{"output_type":"stream","name":"stdout","text":["\n","BIKE RENTAL DEMAND FORECASTING\n","\n","BUSINESS OBJECTIVE\n","Predict hourly bike rental demand using historical,\n","calendar, weather and environmental data.\n","\n","DATASET\n","Original rows: 17,379\n","Original columns: 18\n","Starting date: 2011-01-01 00:00:00\n","Ending date: 2012-12-31 23:00:00\n","Missing values: 0\n","Exact duplicate rows: 0\n","\n","DEMAND SUMMARY\n","Average hourly demand: 189.46\n","Maximum hourly demand: 977\n","Highest average-demand hour: 17:00\n","\n","MODEL RESULTS\n","Best model: Histogram Gradient Boosting\n","MAE: 29.111\n","RMSE: 46.349\n","R2: 0.9555\n","MAPE: 25.95%\n","\n","MODEL STRATEGY\n","A chronological train-test split was used.\n","The first 80% of observations were used for training.\n","The latest 20% were used for future-period testing.\n","TimeSeriesSplit wa